      <ns0:shape width="425.6569291338583" height="100" topLeftX="23.671181102362198" topLeftY="372.38992125984254" presetHandlers="0" type="round-rect" id="bHp">
        <ns0:content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left">
          <ns0:p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4" marginRight="0" defaultTabSize="72"><ns0:em><ns0:span color="rgba(29, 29, 26, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="DengXian" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">相比通用大模型直接问答：把信号处理做成 Agent 工具链，结论基于真实波形而非纯文本推测；</ns0:span></ns0:em></ns0:p>
          <ns0:p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4" marginRight="0" defaultTabSize="72"><ns0:em><ns0:span color="rgba(29, 29, 26, 1)" fontSize="15" fontFamily="DengXian" bold="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">结合 VitalDB 公开数据可复现、可验证；学术上沿 Sel(2023) → IOHFuseLM(2025) → wPINNs(2026) 递进落地。</ns0:span></ns0:em></ns0:p>
        </ns0:content>
